      "writtenOn": "2024-02-07T20:11:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need a dedicated build target for Google3 sdk drop because this flag depends on the build flag `\"RELEASE_HIDDEN_API_EXPORTABLE_STUBS\"` AND the aconfig flag `\"com.android.libcore.v_apis\"`. As of now, these flags are not and should not be turned on for `trunk_staging` release config as setting these flags to true lead to significant increase in incremental build time. If a dedicated build target for Google3 sdk drop is created, then I believe that we can turn on all three flags for that target.",
